# A seeded canvas is a multi-megabyte build artifact. The .dc.html artboards
# beside it are the source, and the canvas is rebuilt from them with the
# `design` skill.
#
# support.js is NOT ignored. It is the canvas runtime the artboards load, it is
# only ~70 KB, and without it none of them opens in a browser.
#
# Scoped to this folder on purpose: other sessions share the root .gitignore
# and file ownership is being kept disjoint.
*-design-system.html
